@startuml Sequence_Authentication
title Diagramme de séquence — Connexion utilisateur

actor Joueur as U
participant "Angular\n(AuthService)" as FE
participant "AuthController" as AC
participant "AuthService" as AS
database "SQLite\n(Prisma)" as DB

U -> FE : saisir email / mot de passe
FE -> AC : POST /api/auth/login
AC -> AS : login(email, password)
AS -> DB : find User by email
AS -> AS : bcrypt.compare(password)
AS -> AS : sign JWT
AC -> FE : Set-Cookie square_one_access_token\n+ user JSON
FE -> FE : stocker état utilisateur
FE --> U : redirection dashboard / lobby

note over FE, AC
  Les requêtes suivantes envoient
  le cookie (credentials) ou
  Authorization: Bearer <token>
end note

U -> FE : accès route protégée
FE -> AC : GET /api/auth/me
AC -> AC : verifyToken middleware
AC -> AS : getMe(userId)
AS -> DB : find User
AC --> FE : profil utilisateur

@enduml
